(`Set tally to 5.` on a name nothing else declares brings `tally` into being,
 and a function may read it like any other global. The fix for
 docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #92 stops such a write claiming a kind, so this pins the
 half it must keep doing - registering the name.)

To report.
    Print tally.

Set tally to 5.
report.
